IW4L (modified)
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

The iw4l/ directory contains a modified copy of IW4L.

  IW4L - Copyright 2026 vladtrc
  https://github.com/vladtrc/iw4L
  Licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0.

Base revision: 4d65a39376e14390abe21bd9ad24a28c2687e90f

Ermes_x86 (Payne) modified IW4L to run as a gameplay runtime for the GTA
San Andreas bridge. The changes are active only when the IW4L_GTA_BRIDGE
environment variable is set; standalone IW4L behaviour is preserved. Changed
areas include:
  - crates/bootstrap: GTA bridge (shared memory, input, collision, camera,
    offscreen rendering and readback, inventory, lock-on, projectiles)
  - crates/sim, crates/net: external movement backend, host weapon lock,
    host-resolved melee, projectile detonation requests
  - crates/render_frontend, crates/render_gpu, crates/hud: source-map
    suppression and overlay presentation
  - crates/audio, crates/sim script host: source-map ambience, radar ping
    and match music filtering
  - crates/console: background account saving

IW4L's own NOTICE, LICENSE and THIRD-PARTY-LICENSES.txt are kept unchanged
in iw4l/ and apply to that directory and to the runtime built from it.

