Other projects
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

plugin-sdk - https://github.com/DK22Pac/plugin-sdk (MIT License)
  The native bridge (bridge/) is built against plugin-sdk for GTA SA. It is
  not vendored in this repository.

The release installer only links to, and does not bundle, the MixMods
"SA Essentials" pack (https://www.mixmods.com.br/2019/06/sa-essentials-pack/)
and the ASI loaders it contains.

