Game content
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

No Call of Duty or Grand Theft Auto game data is contained in this repository
or in any MW2-GTA release. MW2-GTA reads game data from copies of the games the
user already owns. Call of Duty, Modern Warfare, Grand Theft Auto, San Andreas,
related trademarks and all original game assets belong to their respective
owners. MW2-GTA is not affiliated with, endorsed by or supported by
